            Children &amp; Youth Ministry
          </p>

          <p class="arrows-hero-text mb-6">
            Arrows in the Quiver is a youth-focused outreach and
            discipleship initiative of Town Crier Evangelical Ministries,
            created to rescue and raise teenagers as godly, purposeful,
            and well-formed vessels for Christ. The project reflects the
            biblical picture of children and young people as “arrows” in
            God’s hand, prepared, sharpened, and released for divine
            purpose.
          </p>

          <p class="arrows-hero-quote">
            "Like arrows in the hands of a warrior, so are children
            born in one's youth" - Psalm 127:4
